---
// Bouton « Télécharger mon CV » : au clic, affiche la liste des versions du CV (une par profil)
// au lieu de lancer directement un téléchargement. La langue du site choisit le fichier.
// Le bouton par défaut est celui du hero ; le pied de page fournit le sien via le slot « trigger ».
import Button from '@components/ui/atoms/Button.astro';
import { profile, cvFile } from '@data/portfolio/profile';
import { getNovaCopy, type NovaLocale } from '@utils/nova-i18n';

interface Props {
  locale: NovaLocale;
  /** Sens d'ouverture de la liste : vers le bas (hero) ou vers le haut (pied de page). */
  placement?: 'down' | 'up';
  class?: string;
}

const { locale, placement = 'down', class: className } = Astro.props;
const ui = getNovaCopy(locale);
const listId = `cv-menu-${placement}`;
const heading = { fr: 'Choisir une version du CV', en: 'Choose a resume version' }[locale];
---

<div class:list={['pf-cv', className]} data-cv-menu data-placement={placement}>
  <slot name="trigger">
    <Button
      type="button"
      variant="outline"
      size="lg"
      class="min-h-11 w-full font-semibold sm:w-auto"
      data-cv-trigger
      aria-haspopup="true"
      aria-expanded="false"
      aria-controls={listId}
    >
      <i slot="icon-left" class="ph ph-download-simple text-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      {ui.hero.downloadCv}
      <span slot="icon-right" class="inline-flex"><svg class="pf-cv__caret" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 6 8 10.5 12.5 6"/></svg></span>
    </Button>
  </slot>

  <div id={listId} class="pf-cv__panel" hidden>
    <p class="pf-cv__heading">{heading}</p>
    <ul class="pf-cv__list">
      {profile.cvVersions.map((cv) => (
        <li>
          <a
            href={cvFile(cv.id, locale)}
            class="pf-cv__item"
            download={`${locale === 'fr' ? 'CV' : 'Resume'}_Yassir_Drissi_${cv.id}.pdf`}
          >
            <i class="ph ph-file-pdf pf-cv__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="pf-cv__text">
              <span class="pf-cv__title">{cv.label[locale]}</span>
              <span class="pf-cv__desc">{cv.description[locale]}</span>
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<style is:global>
  .pf-cv {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .pf-cv {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  .pf-cv__panel {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 200;
    width: min(22rem, calc(100vw - 2.5rem));
    padding: 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 48px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.22);
  }

  .pf-cv__panel[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .pf-cv__heading {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem 0.25rem;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .pf-cv__list {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .pf-cv__item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 150ms ease;
  }

  .pf-cv__item:hover,
  .pf-cv__item:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-surface-container-low);
    outline: none;
  }

  .pf-cv__item:focus-visible {
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--color-brand-accent);
  }

  .pf-cv__icon {
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
    color: var(--color-brand-accent);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .pf-cv__text {
    display: flex;
    min-width: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.1rem;
  }

  .pf-cv__title {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .pf-cv__desc {
    color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .pf-cv__caret {
    transition: transform 200ms ease;
  }

  [data-cv-trigger][aria-expanded='true'] .pf-cv__caret {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }
</style>

<script is:inline data-astro-rerun>
  (function () {
    if (window.__pfCvMenu) return;
    window.__pfCvMenu = true;

    function panelOf(trigger) {
      return document.getElementById(trigger.getAttribute('aria-controls'));
    }

    function close(trigger) {
      var panel = panelOf(trigger);
      if (panel) panel.hidden = true;
      trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
    }

    function closeAll(except) {
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-cv-trigger]').forEach(function (t) {
        if (t !== except) close(t);
      });
    }

    // Le panneau est placé dans <body> : le hero a overflow:hidden et des animations qui
    // créent des contextes d'empilement, ce qui le masquerait ou le recouvrirait.
    function open(trigger, byKeyboard) {
      var panel = panelOf(trigger);
      if (!panel) return;
      if (panel.parentElement !== document.body) document.body.appendChild(panel);
      panel.hidden = false;
      var r = trigger.getBoundingClientRect();
      var pw = panel.offsetWidth;
      var ph = panel.offsetHeight;
      var spaceBelow = window.innerHeight - r.bottom;
      var below = spaceBelow >= ph + 16 || spaceBelow >= r.top;
      var top = below ? r.bottom + 8 : r.top - ph - 8;
      var left = Math.min(Math.max(12, r.left), window.innerWidth - pw - 12);
      panel.style.top = Math.max(8, top) + window.scrollY + 'px';
      panel.style.left = left + window.scrollX + 'px';
      trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
      if (byKeyboard) {
        var first = panel.querySelector('a');
        if (first) first.focus();
      }
    }

    document.addEventListener('click', function (event) {
      var target = event.target;
      var trigger = target.closest && target.closest('[data-cv-trigger]');
      if (trigger) {
        var wasOpen = trigger.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
        closeAll(trigger);
        if (wasOpen) close(trigger);
        else open(trigger, event.detail === 0);
        return;
      }
      // Clic sur un choix : le téléchargement démarre, on referme la liste.
      // Clic ailleurs : on referme aussi (sauf dans le panneau lui-même).
      if (target.closest && target.closest('.pf-cv__panel') && !target.closest('.pf-cv__item')) return;
      setTimeout(function () { closeAll(null); }, 0);
    });

    document.addEventListener('keydown', function (event) {
      if (event.key !== 'Escape') return;
      var opened = document.querySelector('[data-cv-trigger][aria-expanded="true"]');
      if (!opened) return;
      close(opened);
      opened.focus();
    });

    window.addEventListener('resize', function () { closeAll(null); });
  })();
</script>
